Scoped NIST SPHERE header reader

The header walk, key prefixes, sscanf conversions, codec selection and data
offset in src/nistsphere.ts follow libavformat/nistspheredec.c (nist_probe,
nist_read_header), aviobuf.c (ff_get_line) and utils.c (ff_get_pcm_codec_id).
